{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1501.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"92bc0dc04b16914d33181869b30919138944de473208d3cf32247001c7dd1486","ja":"あ、志保、お疲れさま～！\nはい、これ♪","zh":"啊，志保，辛苦啦～！\n给你，这个♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1501.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"08d07ff1be5a7de922391983b1e628102911bf611a79f7ad0eaf88b3256ddc1b","ja":"……えっ！？\nこの絵本、売り切れたはずじゃ……！","zh":"……咦！？\n这本绘本，应该已经卖完了才对……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1501.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4267a659ac84827b63a7e15553ef341d92f96db40fe148e20dab0d753fe19b44","ja":"うん。\n最後の一冊になってたから、買っておいたんだ！","zh":"嗯。\n因为只剩最后一本了，我就买下来了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1501.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f1432b5b461d990d398e53aed184229b1905f39d927c0248d72680d470eb334a","ja":"この本、売り切れてたのを、\nフェアに合わせて再入荷したんだって。","zh":"这本书之前卖光了，\n听说配合展销活动又重新进货了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1501.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"1636881e38bd52f2cdb22024fbef90785757082919aa981c6d8e0d7af30a0c5d","ja":"だから、次にいつ買えるかわからない、って。","zh":"所以说，不知道下次什么时候才能买到啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1501.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b4026afd14dac44efe115f54e206abcc2845220dea0f6294ee8a1ec93dd24b90","ja":"でも、どうして未来が？","zh":"不过，为什么是未来？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1501.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"f0b47a697b92ef42687ee2311c4a608e8ff55b13bad18742d89eb5e46af467f9","ja":"でへへ～。イベントの前に\n志保がじっと見てたから、欲しいのかなって。","zh":"嘿嘿～。因为在活动之前\n志保一直盯着看，我还以为你想要呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1501.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"787c6602f90cb19233dd5b5420bdadf088c12d669cccc83290d5f28c1818bf1c","ja":"欲しいものが売り切れちゃってたら、\n悲しいもんね！","zh":"要是想要的东西卖光了，\n会很难过的嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1501.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f4f4683070dac01628b0ec883bca5a6ab87575c60e1ba67327f6ed2b7f37ecff","ja":"うん……よかった。\n……未来、ありがとう。","zh":"嗯……太好了。\n……未来，谢谢你。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1501.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1b2bb20a0bc642b9c17363f43d8f09d37a5c69d520be625d69586553d1df4086","ja":"どういたしまして♪　表紙のキツネ、\nカワイイよね！　どんなお話なのかな～？","zh":"不客气♪　封面上的狐狸\n真可爱呢！会是什么样的故事呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1501.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"1f293680b17f195ea646367c86e1115343c5e46e545eed9225f876fb15b0db48","ja":"すごく元気になるお話なんだって。\n……よかったら、今から一緒に読まない？","zh":"据说是个能让人变得超级有精神的故事呢。\n……如果不介意的话，现在要不要一起读？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
